> when is netflix charged?
  model → get_subscription({"id":"sub_X"})
  exhale ← error: subscription sub_X: not found (check the id with list_subscriptions or get_context)
  model → list_subscriptions({"query":"netflix"})
  exhale ← ok
  model → get_subscription({"id":"sub_X"})
  exhale ← ok
< Netflix is charged next on 12 November.
  [link] Netflix
